- Validate and sanitize all uploaded files; restrict allowed MIME types.
- Store uploads outside the web root if possible.
- Document and comply with GDPR and privacy requirements.
- Provide data export and erasure tools for users.

## Examples

```php
// Restrict allowed file types
add_filter( 'upload_mimes', function( $mimes ) {
    $mimes['pdf'] = 'application/pdf';
    unset( $mimes['exe'] );
    return $mimes;
});
```

```php
// GDPR: Provide data export
add_action( 'init', function() {
    if ( isset( $_GET['myplugin_export_data'] ) && current_user_can( 'export_own_data' ) ) {
        // Export user data logic here
    }
});
```

